qualified bidder. As a result of signing the Letter of Concurrence, the City agrees
to amend estimated costs to match the actual bid amount.
E.
Upon completion and acceptance of this project, the City shall maintain, at its sole
expense, all features constructed under this Agreement. Maintenance shall include
