U.
Sovereign Immunity and Limitations. Pursuant to Wyo. Stat.§ 1-39-104(a), the
State of Wyoming and WYDOT expressly reserve sovereign immunity by entering
into this Agreement and the City expressly reserves governmental immunity. Each
